# 20 — Security / auth

## WebAuthn (#118)

Passkeys are **disabled by default**. Gate is `WEBAUTHN_ENABLED` (opt-in, default false). Register/login options and verify-registration must 503 when off. Password-only register UI until assertion verify + RP/origin parity is cleared.

Do not “complete” WebAuthn by turning the flag on in production.

## Registration (#117)

`registerUser` must **not** set `User.role = ADMIN`. Schema default is `"user"`. First tenant owner may be tenant-scoped ADMIN via membership, not a global role.

JWT/session callbacks must not fall back to global ADMIN.

## Tenant isolation (existing AGENTS.md)

- Tenant id only from verified session + `TenantMembership`.
- Never from body, query, or untrusted headers.
- Fail closed: 401/403.

## Secrets

- `#105` removed committed WhatsApp verification credentials. Do not put them back.
- Run `npm run test:secrets` / `pnpm test:secrets` equivalent before done.
- Drive backups of `.env*` are exposed; rotate in providers, never copy values here.

